    lifecycle.test.ts:2005  behaviour 2, five refusal rows, flag supplied via ...row.args
    lifecycle.test.ts:2033  behaviour 3, four recording rows, flag supplied via ...row.args
                            (the "env-alone" row deliberately has no flag)

  out of scope, pre-existing, and unreachable by the new guard (7) — behaviour 11's usage refusals:
    lifecycle.test.ts:548, 551, 554, 557, 560, 563, 566
    Each refuses BEFORE the new check. Verified against the source order in
